ng":0},"body":"Hi team. We ran an automated security audit using Veritensor on all 2000+ repositories in this list. We found that 120+ servers expose dangerous tools (like [subprocess.run](http://subprocess.run/) without human-in-the-loop) directly to the LLM. Here is the [full report](https://hackernoon.com/security-audit-finds-rce-risks-in-62percent-of-mcp-servers). We're sharing these findings to help the community. We'd be happy to mark servers that pass the Veritensor scan with a ✅ Scanned badge — we can provide a GitHub Action for that. Happy to discuss.","closed_by":{"login":"punkpeye","id":108313943,"node_id":"U_kgDOBnS9Vw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108313943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye","html_url":"https://github.com/punkpeye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/punkpeye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/5913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/5913/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}